      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 55,
      "number": 123,
      "number_raw": "123",
      "source_number": "123",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "别磨叽！",
      "source_text": "别磨叽！",
      "source_line_start": 68,
      "source_line_end": 68,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 56,
      "number": 124,
      "number_raw": "124",
      "source_number": "124",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "嘿，这是兄弟会的地盘，不赶紧滚的话我就马上把你打成筛子。",
      "source_text": "嘿，这是兄弟会的地盘，不赶紧滚的话我就马上把你打成筛子。",
      "source_line_start": 69,
      "source_line_end": 69,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 57,
      "number": 125,
      "number_raw": "125",
      "source_number": "125",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "很好，继续吧，新兵。",
      "source_text": "很好，继续吧，新兵。",
      "source_line_start": 70,
      "source_line_end": 70,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 58,
      "number": 126,
      "number_raw": "126",
      "source_number": "126",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我知道，继续吧，新兵。",
      "source_text": "我知道，继续吧，新兵。",
      "source_line_start": 71,
      "source_line_end": 71,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 59,
      "number": 127,
      "number_raw": "127",
      "source_number": "127",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "这里有很多变种人袭击过往商队的报告，所以我们不断在提高警惕。严格巡逻，并在必要时可选择撤退。切记啊，新兵！",
      "source_text": "这里有很多变种人袭击过往商队的报告，所以我们不断在提高警惕。严格巡逻，并在必要时可选择撤退。切记啊，新兵！",
      "source_line_start": 72,
      "source_line_end": 72,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 60,
      "number": 128,
      "number_raw": "128",
      "source_number": "128",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "有麻烦了，新兵！变种人四处出击，袭击过往商队。我们需要请了解最新战况，现在！没有情报就是最坏的情报！",
      "source_text": "有麻烦了，新兵！变种人四处出击，袭击过往商队。我们需要请了解最新战况，现在！没有情报就是最坏的情报！",
      "source_line_start": 73,
      "source_line_end": 73,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 61,
      "number": 129,
      "number_raw": "129",
      "source_number": "129",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Get your sorry ass out of here, and bring us back some useful intelligence!# Initiate, dismissed!",
      "source_text": "Get your sorry ass out of here, and bring us back some useful intelligence!\n# Initiate, dismissed!",
      "source_line_start": 75,
      "source_line_end": 76,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 62,
      "number": 130,
      "number_raw": "130",
      "source_number": "130",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Oh yes, I heard about you. Not much of an IQ, but a helluva fighter.# Too bad.",
      "source_text": "Oh yes, I heard about you. Not much of an IQ, but a helluva fighter.\n# Too bad.",
      "source_line_start": 77,
      "source_line_end": 78,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 63,
      "number": 131,
      "number_raw": "131",
      "source_number": "131",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "This is our land, and here, your business is our business. I repeat,# state your business.",
      "source_text": "This is our land, and here, your business is our business. I repeat,\n# state your business.",
      "source_line_start": 79,
      "source_line_end": 80,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 64,
      "number": 132,
      "number_raw": "132",
      "source_number": "132",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I seek a water chip for my Vault. Can you help me?",
      "source_text": "I seek a water chip for my Vault. Can you help me?",
      "source_line_start": 81,
      "source_line_end": 81,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 65,
      "number": 133,
      "number_raw": "133",
      "source_number": "133",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I am trying to find the source of mutant attacks.",
      "source_text": "I am trying to find the source of mutant attacks.",
      "source_line_start": 82,
      "source_line_end": 82,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 66,
      "number": 134,
      "number_raw": "134",
      "source_number": "134",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "This may be your land, but I am not your slave.",
      "source_text": "This may be your land, but I am not your slave.",
      "source_line_start": 83,
      "source_line_end": 83,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 67,
      "number": 135,
      "number_raw": "135",
      "source_number": "135",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I've been wandering the wastes for a long time. I wanted to know if# you have news.",
      "source_text": "I've been wandering the wastes for a long time. I wanted to know if\n# you have news.",
      "source_line_start": 84,
      "source_line_end": 85,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 68,
      "number": 136,
      "number_raw": "136",
      "source_number": "136",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "A friendly face? It won't be mine. I would recommend leaving.",
      "source_text": "A friendly face? It won't be mine. I would recommend leaving.",
      "source_line_start": 86,
      "source_line_end": 86,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 69,
      "number": 137,
      "number_raw": "137",
      "source_number": "137",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "As are we all. As long as you do not act against the Brotherhood, you# will not be harmed, but tread carefully.",
      "source_text": "As are we all. As long as you do not act against the Brotherhood, you\n# will not be harmed, but tread carefully.",
      "source_line_start": 87,
      "source_line_end": 88,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 70,
      "number": 138,
      "number_raw": "138",
      "source_number": "138",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "It depends on whether or not you consider us vermin. If you attack our# enemies, you will be permitted to travel in our territory. If you offend us,# you will die. Consider yourself warned.",
      "source_text": "It depends on whether or not you consider us vermin. If you attack our\n# enemies, you will be permitted to travel in our territory. If you offend us,\n# you will die. Consider yourself warned.",
      "source_line_start": 89,
      "source_line_end": 91,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 71,
      "number": 139,
      "number_raw": "139",
      "source_number": "139",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "That's a reasonable request. Fall in.",
      "source_text": "That's a reasonable request. Fall in.",
      "source_line_start": 92,
      "source_line_end": 92,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 72,
      "number": 129,
      "number_raw": "129",
      "source_number": "129",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "带上你的混主意滚，下次带点脑子来，记住了，新兵！",
      "source_text": "带上你的混主意滚，下次带点脑子来，记住了，新兵！",
      "source_line_start": 93,
      "source_line_end": 93,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 73,
      "number": 130,
      "number_raw": "130",
      "source_number": "130",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "哦，是的，我听说过你。智商不高，却是个呱呱叫的战士，太可惜了。",
      "source_text": "哦，是的，我听说过你。智商不高，却是个呱呱叫的战士，太可惜了。",
      "source_line_start": 94,
      "source_line_end": 94,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 74,
      "number": 131,
      "number_raw": "131",
      "source_number": "131",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "这是我们的地盘,这里，你的事情就是我们的事情，我再问一次,你来这是干什么的？",
      "source_text": "这是我们的地盘,这里，你的事情就是我们的事情，我再问一次,你来这是干什么的？",
      "source_line_start": 95,
      "source_line_end": 95,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 75,
      "number": 132,
      "number_raw": "132",
      "source_number": "132",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我在为我的避难所寻找净水芯片，能帮帮忙吗？",
      "source_text": "我在为我的避难所寻找净水芯片，能帮帮忙吗？",
      "source_line_start": 96,
      "source_line_end": 96,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 76,
      "number": 133,
      "number_raw": "133",
      "source_number": "133",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我在寻找变种人出袭的原因。",
      "source_text": "我在寻找变种人出袭的原因。",
      "source_line_start": 97,
      "source_line_end": 97,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 77,
      "number": 134,
      "number_raw": "134",
      "source_number": "134",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "虽然这是你的地盘，但这可不意味我什么都要听你的。",
      "source_text": "虽然这是你的地盘，但这可不意味我什么都要听你的。",
      "source_line_start": 98,
      "source_line_end": 98,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 78,
      "number": 135,
      "number_raw": "135",
      "source_number": "135",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我花了很多时间在废土上乱转。我想从你这打听点情报。",
      "source_text": "我花了很多时间在废土上乱转。我想从你这打听点情报。",
      "source_line_start": 99,
      "source_line_end": 99,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 79,
      "number": 136,
      "number_raw": "136",
      "source_number": "136",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "一张好脸？有也不是我的，我建议你快离开。",
      "source_text": "一张好脸？有也不是我的，我建议你快离开。",
      "source_line_start": 100,
      "source_line_end": 100,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 80,
      "number": 137,
      "number_raw": "137",
      "source_number": "137",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "兄弟会面对任何人的态度都是：人不犯我，我不犯人，不过你最好处处小心。",
      "source_text": "兄弟会面对任何人的态度都是：人不犯我，我不犯人，不过你最好处处小心。",
      "source_line_start": 101,
      "source_line_end": 101,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 81,
      "number": 138,
      "number_raw": "138",
      "source_number": "138",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "这要看你认为我们是不是沙漠害虫。如果敢帮我们去做掉几个敌人，那么就获得了我们管辖区的通行权。如果敢和我们作对，就等着死去吧，何去何从，好好想想吧。",
      "source_text": "这要看你认为我们是不是沙漠害虫。如果敢帮我们去做掉几个敌人，那么就获得了我们管辖区的通行权。如果敢和我们作对，就等着死去吧，何去何从，好好想想吧。",
      "source_line_start": 102,
      "source_line_end": 102,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 82,
      "number": 139,
      "number_raw": "139",
      "source_number": "139",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "合理的要求，我们成交。",
      "source_text": "合理的要求，我们成交。",
      "source_line_start": 103,
      "source_line_end": 103,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 83,
      "number": 140,
      "number_raw": "140",
      "source_number": "140",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Water chip? I hope you're not serious! You'd be better off struggling# on the surface than enslaving yourself to a single piece of machinery.",
      "source_text": "Water chip? I hope you're not serious! You'd be better off struggling\n# on the surface than enslaving yourself to a single piece of machinery.",
      "source_line_start": 104,
      "source_line_end": 105,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 84,
      "number": 141,
      "number_raw": "141",
      "source_number": "141",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "As are we. The most common theory is that they come from the Glow, but# I doubt even mutants could survive there for long. If you find out# something, let us know.",
      "source_text": "As are we. The most common theory is that they come from the Glow, but\n# I doubt even mutants could survive there for long. If you find out\n# something, let us know.",
      "source_line_start": 106,
      "source_line_end": 108,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 85,
      "number": 142,
      "number_raw": "142",
      "source_number": "142",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "How dare you accuse me of such a thing! The Brotherhood of Steel has# never forced anyuone to serve us against their will. That goes against everything# we believe in. Get out of my sight!",
      "source_text": "How dare you accuse me of such a thing! The Brotherhood of Steel has\n# never forced anyuone to serve us against their will. That goes against everything\n# we believe in. Get out of my sight!",
      "source_line_start": 109,
      "source_line_end": 111,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 86,
      "number": 143,
      "number_raw": "143",
      "source_number": "143",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "We found a wrecked caravan about a day's journey to the west. We found# one survivor - poor girl. She claimed they were attacked by mutant humans# with incredible strength.",
      "source_text": "We found a wrecked caravan about a day's journey to the west. We found\n# one survivor - poor girl. She claimed they were attacked by mutant humans\n# with incredible strength.",
      "source_line_start": 112,
      "source_line_end": 114,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 87,
      "number": 144,
      "number_raw": "144",
      "source_number": "144",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "We've heard enough reports that we're . . . concerned. I would walk# cautiously, if I were you.",
      "source_text": "We've heard enough reports that we're . . . concerned. I would walk\n# cautiously, if I were you.",
      "source_line_start": 115,
      "source_line_end": 116,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 88,
      "number": 145,
      "number_raw": "145",
      "source_number": "145",
